<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Verify Your Email</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f6f9;
      color: #333333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .wrapper {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #11998e 0%, #38ef7d 100%);
      padding: 40px 40px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .header p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a2e;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .message {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #555555;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .info-box {
      background: #f0fdf4;
      border-left: 4px solid #38ef7d;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .info-box p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #14532d;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: block;
      width: fit-content;
      margin: 32px auto;
      padding: 14px 36px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #11998e 0%, #38ef7d 100%);
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .url-fallback {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 16px 0;
      word-break: break-all;
    }
    .url-fallback p {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .url-fallback code {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #333;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: #eef0f3;
      margin: 32px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 24px 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #888888;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #11998e;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Verify Your Email ✉️</h1>
      <p>One last step to complete your registration</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</p>

      <p class="message">
        Thank you for registering! To complete your account setup and gain full access
        to our platform, please verify your email address by clicking the button below.
      </p>

      <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" class="cta-button">Verify My Email →</a>

      <div class="info-box">
        <p>
          ⏰ <strong>This link expires in {{expiresIn}}.</strong>
          If it expires, you can request a new verification email from the login page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="url-fallback">
        <p>If the button above doesn't work, copy and paste this URL into your browser:</p>
        <code>{{verifyUrl}}</code>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <p class="message" style="font-size: 14px;">
        <strong>Didn't create an account?</strong> If you didn't register at our platform,
        you can safely ignore this email. No account will be created without verification.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>
        This email was sent to <strong>{{email}}</strong> because you registered at
        <a href="{{appUrl}}">our platform</a>.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">© {{year}} All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
